    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Come celebrate the holiday season and support our local foodbank with Viva Chorale\\'s annual holiday concert fundraiser! This year the choir will sing carols interspersed with a lovely story from the UK: The Mousehole Cat. The tale follows the adventures of Mowzer the cat and her faithful human fisher, Tom Bawcock. This is a traditional [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
